# Firebase service account key for NotificationService (Firebase:CredentialPath).
# It is mounted into the container at runtime; committing it would leak a
# credential with FCM send + project access. Pattern also matches the
# self-documented location in NotificationService/FIREBASE_SETUP.md.
firebase-credentials.json

